---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="AC Not Turning On | AC Repair Wake Forest NC" description="AC won't start in Wake Forest? Common causes and same-day repair.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>AC Not Turning On</h1>
      <p>AC won't start in Wake Forest? Common causes and same-day repair.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>An air conditioner that refuses to turn on leaves you without cooling when you need it most. Common causes include a tripped breaker, failed capacitor, bad contactor, thermostat failure, or a safety switch that has opened.</p>
      <p>Our technicians arrive prepared with the parts most often needed for no-start situations and can usually restore operation on the first visit.</p>
      <h2>Get Help Today</h2>
      <p>Don't wait in the heat. Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>(919) 555-0199</a> for same-day diagnosis and repair in Wake Forest, Rolesville, and surrounding areas.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call (919) 555-0199</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>